- G>B | keep half for the family and stake only the other half | v: security, tradition | foot: means money+.03 | chance: 85
works: The money lands before breakfast, and {N} reads the figure three times.
works: The buyer rings again a week later, asking what else {N} can find.
fails: The buyer backs out at dawn, and the furniture fills the garage for a month.
