scene G: {friend} is standing right there, and {N} knows {friend} has had it too.
- W | report it in writing, with dates, and insist it is dealt with | v: conformity, security | foot: lesson put it on paper | chance: 60
- U | turn the audience with a joke that has everyone laughing at the bully | v: self-direction | foot: means ties+.03 | chance: 55
