- B>G | gather everyone the bully has picked on, and face it together | v: benevolence, power | foot: place gather.circle | chance: 58
- R>W | call it out loudly, for everyone else it has been done to | v: universalism (fairness), stimulation | foot: means freedom+.03 | chance: 55
- G>U | walk away calmly, and think about why they need to do it at all | v: security | dream: drop | foot: lesson some fights are not worth it | chance: 70
works: {rival} laughs, falters, and looks away first, and the whole room sees it.
works: It never happens again, and {N} walks a little taller from that day.
fails: {rival} only laughs louder, and {N} goes home shaking.
fails: It ends with both of them in front of someone in charge, and {N} gets the blame.

