scene: {N} has a basket of wild mushrooms from the beech wood, the best haul yet. The chef from the restaurant on the square has come out to the back door to look.
scene W: {N} picked only what the old forager's rules allow: never the last one, never the small ones.
scene U: {N} has checked every one against two field guides and a spore print.
